{"series":{"id":"release-witch","slug":"release-witch","title":"Release That Witch","image":"https://donghualife.com/images/webp/release-witch-1__coverImage.webp","synopsis":"✨ Chen Yan, un ingeniero del mundo moderno, reencarna como Roland, el cuarto príncipe del Reino de Graycastle, en un mundo similar a la Europa medieval donde las brujas y la magia existen de verdad. Tras rescatar a la bruja Anna, descubre que la magia puede convertirse en una nueva fuerza productiva capaz de reemplazar la tecnología moderna.Desafiando el odio hacia las brujas, Roland las recluta para desarrollar una industria mágica, transformar Border Town y fortalecer su territorio. Entre intrigas políticas, guerras y conspiraciones, su ambición lo llevará a unificar el reino y revelar los secretos ocultos del mundo🎥 Estudio: Thundray (Celestial Bonds)","genres":["Fantasía","Isekai","Drama","Romance","Magia"],"sourceUrl":"https://donghualife.com/series/release-witch","updatedAt":"2026-10-24T21:35:26.041Z"},"seasons":[{"id":"release-witch-1","slug":"release-witch-1","sourceUrl":"https://donghualife.com/watch/release-witch-1-1","image":null,"number":1,"seriesId":"release-witch","firstEpisodeUrl":"https://donghualife.com/watch/release-witch-1-1","updatedAt":"2026-10-24T21:35:30.451Z","episodeCount":8,"minEpisodeFound":1,"maxEpisodeFound":8,"missingEpisodes":[],"paginationComplete":true,"initialSyncComplete":true}],"episodes":[{"id":"release-witch-1-1","slug":"release-witch-1-1","title":"Release That Witch — Cap. 1","sourceUrl":"https://donghualife.com/watch/release-witch-1-1","servers":[],"previousUrl":null,"nextUrl":"https://donghualife.com/watch/release-witch-1-2","updatedAt":"2026-10-24T21:35:26.575Z","seriesId":"release-witch","seasonId":"release-witch-1","number":1,"releaseDate":null},{"id":"release-witch-1-2","slug":"release-witch-1-2","title":"Release That Witch — Cap. 2","sourceUrl":"https://donghualife.com/watch/release-witch-1-2","servers":[],"previousUrl":"https://donghualife.com/watc